join wise_crab center
wise_crab: Hello
wise_crab: I am a wise old crab who has wandered these lands for over three thousand years
wise_crab: I wish to give you some money
wise_crab: In exchange for ending my miserable existence
wise_crab: I am so old that my shell has rendered me immobile
wise_crab: Please end my suffering
- Sure, I'll kill you
	wise_crab: Thank you kind soul
	[signal arg="give_money"]
- No, I refuse to
	wise_crab: Fuck you then.
	[signal arg="fuck_you"]
- I'm too weak to kill you
	wise_crab: You literally have a gun there
	Just kill me
	- Fine.
		wise_crab: Thank you kind soul
		[signal arg="give_money"]
	- No.
